      "before0000000000": {
        "_id": "before0000000000",
        "type": "base",
        "description": "<p>A lizardfolk acting this turn unearths a magical size 2 pit that is 2 squares deep and filled with water. Any lizardfolk who moves into, then exits the pit on their turn gains [[/heal 10 temporary]], regrows their tail if applicable, and ends one effect on them that can be ended by a saving throw. While adjacent to the pit, any creature who can burrow or who has the Nature skill can make a <strong>Might test or a Reason test</strong> to drain it.</p><dl class=\"power-roll-display\"><dt class=\"tier1\"><p>!</p></dt><dd><p>The creature falls into the pit and is knocked [[/apply prone]].</p></dd><dt class=\"tier2\"><p>@</p></dt><dd><p>The creature fails to empty the pit.</p></dd><dt class=\"tier3\"><p>#</p></dt><dd><p>The pit empties of water.</p></dd></dl>",
